+          "section": "3.29",
+          "text": "## 3.29. Validation\n\n**Definition**\n\nWithin this component, the contextual short form of Identity Validation (§3.20): actual scoped evaluation against applicable responsible mandatory identity rules, not confirmation of every rule in the entire Documentation Framework.\n\n**Notes**\n\nUse DID-007 outcome/coverage meanings and exact subject/domain/rules/artifacts/edition/context, executor, checks and observations. Other check domains retain their owners. Missing/conflicting mandatory authority is not full success or a fabricated violation; preserved negative observations, result recording and separately authorized correction remain distinct. No mutation, approval, publication, Baseline selection or complete implemented conformity follows from the term.\n\n---\n\n"
